    "section_faq_DH8f78": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_AfhhNJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What materials are used in your embroidered suits?",
            "content": "<p>Our embroidered suits are made from high-quality fabrics such as cotton, chiffon, georgette, silk, and lawn. The embroidery is done with intricate thread work and embellishments to ensure premium quality and luxurious designs.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_rF3z3t": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I care for my embroidered suit?",
            "content": "<p>To keep your embroidered suit looking its best, we recommend hand washing or dry cleaning. Avoid using bleach, and for embroidery, it's best to wash the fabric gently to preserve the design. Always follow the care instructions provided with the suit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_CGA6Kw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer international shipping?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, we offer international shipping to a variety of countries. During checkout, you can select your shipping destination, and we will provide the delivery cost and estimated arrival time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_BjmGwt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I track my order?",
            "content": "<p>Once your order has been shipped, you will receive a tracking number via email or SMS. You can use this tracking number on our website or the courier’s website to monitor your shipment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_iHjXA4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I cancel or modify my order?",
            "content": "<p>If you need to cancel or modify your order, please reach out to our customer service team as soon as possible. If the order has not yet been shipped, we will try to accommodate your request. Once shipped, cancellations or modifications are not possible.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_kFrALB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What sizes do you offer?",
            "content": "<p>Our embroidered suits come in a range of sizes, from Extra Small to Extra Large. For custom sizes or to inquire about specific measurements, please contact our customer support, and we’ll be happy to assist you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_qAahRL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer refunds or exchanges?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, we offer refunds or exchanges on items that are returned in their original condition, unworn, and with the tags intact. Please contact our customer service within 7 days of receiving your order to initiate a return or exchange.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_tXaTCA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does it take for my order to be delivered?",
            "content": "<p>Delivery times vary based on your location and the shipping method selected. Typically, orders within Pakistan are delivered in 3-7 business days, while international orders can take 7-14 business days. You will be notified of the estimated delivery time when you place your order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_HV6bQU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer any discounts or promotions?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, we regularly offer promotions and discounts. To stay updated on sales, please subscribe to our newsletter or follow us on social media for the latest offers.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_GXtgAC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I place an order on your website?",
            "content": "<p>Simply browse through our collection of embroidered suits, select your desired items, and add them to your cart. Proceed to checkout, fill in your shipping details, and complete payment using one of the available payment methods. If you need any assistance during the process, our customer service team is here to help.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_T8DxzT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I know if the color of the suit will match the picture online?",
            "content": "<p>We make every effort to ensure our online images are as accurate as possible. However, colors may vary slightly due to different monitor settings or lighting. If you're uncertain, feel free to contact us for more details or additional images of the suit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_iEbzVy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer customization or made-to-order suits?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, we offer customization options for certain designs. If you're interested in tailoring a suit to your preferences, please contact our customer service team, and we’ll guide you through the customization process.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_wAgbtm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What payment methods do you accept?",
            "content": "<p>We accept a variety of payment methods including credit/debit cards & bank transfers. You’ll see the full list of options during checkout.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_ATRBWC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are there any hidden or additional charges besides the listed price?",
            "content": "<p>The price listed on the product page is the final price for the item, but shipping fees might apply depending on your location. These will be clearly shown during checkout before you confirm your order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_tCeEAd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I redeem a discount code on my order?",
            "content": "<p>To use your discount code, simply enter it in the \"Promo Code\" box at checkout, and the discount will be applied to your order total once the code is verified.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_fbTFA4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer bulk or wholesale orders?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, we do offer bulk and wholesale orders. If you're interested, please let me know the details of your order, and I’ll provide you with a custom quote.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_CTDAxh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I have a special request for an outfit. Can I make customizations to the embroidery or design?",
            "content": "<p>We do offer customizations for some designs. Please reach out with your specific request, and I’ll guide you through the process to see how we can accommodate it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_Dy8Rqd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will my order be delivered to my doorstep, or do I need to pick it up?",
            "content": "<p>We deliver all orders directly to your doorstep. Once your order is shipped, you'll receive a tracking number to monitor its progress, and it will be delivered to the address you provided at checkout.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_V6Dy8e": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer cash on delivery (COD) as a payment option?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, we offer cash on delivery (COD) for orders within Pakistan. When you checkout, you can choose COD and pay for your order when it arrives at your door.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_MGrAie": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What should I do if my package is delayed?",
            "content": "<p>If your package is delayed, just let me know, and I’ll help track it down. I can also get in touch with the courier service if needed to resolve the issue.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_Pa8Pkw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are there any limited edition or seasonal collections available?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, we release exclusive limited edition and seasonal collections from time to time. To stay updated, I recommend subscribing to our newsletter or following us on social media for the latest releases.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
